{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"传道书","commonName":"传道书","title":"传道书","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"3f5b39eb02d7a1d6766cabadd5a21eb777a96ecc4aafa2082814665aaa8ba329","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["于是，我又观察日光之下的一切欺压之事。我看见受欺压的泪流满面，无人安慰。因为欺压者有权有势，所以无人安慰他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因此，我认为那已死的人比活着的人幸福。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["不过，比以上两种人更幸运的是那从未出生的人，他们从未见过日光之下的恶行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我又看见人的一切劳碌和成就原是出于争强好胜。这也是虚空，如同捕风。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["愚人游手好闲，最后只能饿死。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["拥有不多，心里安宁，胜过拥有很多，仍劳碌捕风。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我又看见日光之下一件虚空的事："]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["有一个人孤孤单单，没有儿子也没有兄弟，却终身劳碌。他虽然家道丰裕，仍不满足，从未想过：“我不停地劳碌，放弃一切享受，究竟是为了谁？”这也是虚空，是一种悲哀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["两个人总比一个人好，因为二人劳碌同得美好的成果。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["一人跌倒，总有同伴相扶。但孤身一人、跌倒了无人相扶的真悲惨！"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["还有，二人同睡会暖和，一人独睡怎能暖和呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["遭遇攻击，一人独自不能抵挡，二人并肩就能对付。三股拧成的绳子不容易断。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["贫穷但有智慧的青年，胜过年老、愚昧、不再纳谏的君王。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["虽然这青年在本国出身贫寒，却能从囚犯成为君王。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["我看见所有日光之下的人都起来拥护这位代替老君王的青年。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["拥护他的人不计其数，以后的世代却对他不满。这也是虚空，如同捕风。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}